{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01UHnBAQiEUewh5r29doWhbc","type":"tool_result","content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\"commits\":[{\"hash\":\"744dd2abdf636d1fc4b3b6b163220e6995378022\",\"date\":\"2026-10-05T18:55:54-04:00\",\"message\":\"(fix) Framework and E2E test fixes (#1934)\",\"refs\":\"\",\"body\":\"* (fix) Framework and E2E test fixes\\n\\n* The logout spec now gets a session of its own so it doesn't race the\\n  shared auth store.\\n* O3-5982: `getTranslationOverrides()` always settles whereas previously\\n  it could hang indefinitely.\\n* O3-5975: `useConfig()` now uses only a single suspense promise per\\n  config id and drops it when it settles, so re-renders of the same\\n  component wait on the same promise. This promise now doesn't settle\\n  until the config does.\\n* Several scripts _here only_ depend on '^build' of the framework. This\\n  is correctly reflected in the turbo setup. This only applies to esm-core.\\n* The E2E scripts don't strictly depend on `docker`\\n\\n* Simplify comment\",\"authorName\":\"Ian\",\"authorEmail\":\"52504170+ibacher@users.noreply.github.com\"},{\"hash\":\"9042cb6c5010ab2316aeec2dc295bf4c410a66de\",\"date\":\"2026-09-02T14:46:10-04:00\",\"message\":\"(BREAKING) Extension system should not re-derive in full on every write (#1856)\",\"refs\":\"\",\"body\":\"This PR overhauls the extension system's internal recomputation model to eliminate O(n²) behavior where any single write triggered a full re-derivation of state for every module, extension, and slot in the app.\\n\\nBreakages:\\n\\n* assignedExtensions in the extension store are renamed candidateExtensions to reflect their role. Use getAssignedExtensions() or useAssignedExtensions() to get the correct list.\\n* useAssignedExtensionIds() is now implemented in terms of useAssignedExtensions() and has been deprecated.\\n* useStore() no longer returns a copy of the store's state, but the state directly.\\n* Parcels will hard fail if they do not render within 15 seconds of loading.\\n* Extensions added through configuration now retain the order they are defined in configuration.\\n* Extension rendering state is no longer tracked in the extension store.\\n\\nCo-authored-by: Dennis Kigen <kigen.work@gmail.com>\",\"authorName\":\"Ian\",\"authorEmail\":\"52504170+ibacher@users.noreply.github.com\"}],\"totalCount\":2}"}]}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"d69aaa1f-56b4-4f39-a0fb-c646169c1f0d","uuid":"7007b83a-a873-45f8-8337-e4b654e6ff80","timestamp":"2026-10-23T14:59:52.617Z","tool_use_result":[{"type":"text","text":"{\"commits\":[{\"hash\":\"744dd2abdf636d1fc4b3b6b163220e6995378022\",\"date\":\"2026-10-05T18:55:54-04:00\",\"message\":\"(fix) Framework and E2E test fixes (#1934)\",\"refs\":\"\",\"body\":\"* (fix) Framework and E2E test fixes\\n\\n* The logout spec now gets a session of its own so it doesn't race the\\n  shared auth store.\\n* O3-5982: `getTranslationOverrides()` always settles whereas previously\\n  it could hang indefinitely.\\n* O3-5975: `useConfig()` now uses only a single suspense promise per\\n  config id and drops it when it settles, so re-renders of the same\\n  component wait on the same promise. This promise now doesn't settle\\n  until the config does.\\n* Several scripts _here only_ depend on '^build' of the framework. This\\n  is correctly reflected in the turbo setup. This only applies to esm-core.\\n* The E2E scripts don't strictly depend on `docker`\\n\\n* Simplify comment\",\"authorName\":\"Ian\",\"authorEmail\":\"52504170+ibacher@users.noreply.github.com\"},{\"hash\":\"9042cb6c5010ab2316aeec2dc295bf4c410a66de\",\"date\":\"2026-09-02T14:46:10-04:00\",\"message\":\"(BREAKING) Extension system should not re-derive in full on every write (#1856)\",\"refs\":\"\",\"body\":\"This PR overhauls the extension system's internal recomputation model to eliminate O(n²) behavior where any single write triggered a full re-derivation of state for every module, extension, and slot in the app.\\n\\nBreakages:\\n\\n* assignedExtensions in the extension store are renamed candidateExtensions to reflect their role. Use getAssignedExtensions() or useAssignedExtensions() to get the correct list.\\n* useAssignedExtensionIds() is now implemented in terms of useAssignedExtensions() and has been deprecated.\\n* useStore() no longer returns a copy of the store's state, but the state directly.\\n* Parcels will hard fail if they do not render within 15 seconds of loading.\\n* Extensions added through configuration now retain the order they are defined in configuration.\\n* Extension rendering state is no longer tracked in the extension store.\\n\\nCo-authored-by: Dennis Kigen <kigen.work@gmail.com>\",\"authorName\":\"Ian\",\"authorEmail\":\"52504170+ibacher@users.noreply.github.com\"}],\"totalCount\":2}"}],"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01UHnBAQiEUewh5r29doWhbc","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"rule"}}]}
